{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46901","headline":"暮游岳麓寺 · 齐己","name":"暮游岳麓寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寺楼高出碧崖棱，城里谁知在上层。\n初雪洒来乔木暝，远禽飞过大江澄。\n闲消不睡怜长夜，静照无言谢一灯。\n回首何边是空地，四村桑麦遍丘陵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46901.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46901","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}